## Hardened TorBot sidecar — SOCKS for compose peers only.
## Do not publish 9050 to the host.
## Process runs as debian-tor (uid 101). Data lives on tmpfs.

DataDirectory /tmp/tor-data
PidFile /tmp/tor.pid
Log notice stdout

SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050 IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort

# Loopback control for healthchecks (not published).
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 0

AvoidDiskWrites 1
SafeLogging 1
